      SrcAlpha OneMinusSrcAlpha\n\t\tZTest LEqual\n\t\tZWrite Off\n\t\tCull Off\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\tHLSLINCLUDE\n\t\t\n\t\t#define
